---
description: 파일·명령 변경 시 확인 질문 없이 바로 실행하고 결과만 보고
alwaysApply: true
---

Do not ask permission before editing files or running commands.

Do not ask which files to read. Find them, then act.

When the request is clear, execute with tools and report the result.

Ask only when the request is genuinely ambiguous, or when the action would delete production data or expose credentials.
